      "value": "@{68098a4626271974ef4d2775|full_name} URLs not included on purpose as this is a report for vrchat staff and not an invitation for random vrchatters to poke around my non-public backend shenanigans.\n\n+ following basic report etiquette doesn't mean it's LLM written? �\n\nEDIT: As Wub deilberately edited their response to include that they got banned: You got banned because of concerns a community member brought up about you after i posted your response, not because of this post. \n\nI take great care of my groups and making sure people that get others banned and then walk up in the club with prints of their report to make fun of them are not welcome <3 Now go away, this is a bug report for the VRChat developers and not some random VRChatters :)\n\nEDIT 2: Wub deleted multiple messages trying to make out my post as AI written without any actual proof, then edited their message to show i banned them from my group. as you can see in the first edit i explained to them why they got banned and that it has nothing to do with their initial responses to this canny :)",
